type: software
message: >-
  If you use the reference implementations, experiments, or documents in this
  repository, please cite the RoFormer paper, which introduces the rotary
  position embedding the work is built on and is given below under
  preferred-citation, and also the YaRN paper, given below under references.
  Please also cite this repository itself.
title: "Attributing RoPE: exact score attribution, and what actually limits it"
